        "title": "Lauthuan aniu tarou thang njuan",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lauthaun aniu tarou thang njuan guang pukhou,",
            "Rou kham tei lan lou the Khrista kamei @&4na;",
            "Ata kaupui khuan chu, bumang thanmei khuan e,",
            "Jiangri pat ki kamei ding bma khuan e,",
            "Ata kaupui khuan chu Jisu ringthao kanthe,",
            "Dinga bam du kan the,",
            "Kamei khou tei lauthuan.",
            "",
            "2. Jisu ringthao kan the apap guai gulouna,",
            "Kandih rianramei le theimei ta ngam lana;",
            "Nthanliangmei jei tei @&4 ata gulou na,",
            "Adi neila ni cho? Khrista jianloumei hei,",
            "Adi neila ni cho? Khrista jianloumei hei,",
            "Neikhat mu neilana kata ai ariu ni.",
            "",
            "3. Jisu njian loupui lun phuanga ringthao the,",
            "Khrista kamei banjat biak thang bam the;",
            "Ata jai o Khrista banjat @&4na ata,",
            "Kajei pan naiu thei dat pulak khe,",
            "Kathei ai lai tat ni ai ping tuang nai lakkhe,",
            "Tingkauh kaidai thang aniu guanglung chamni."
          ]
        }
      }
